{"id":"85a16660eb135490","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-proof-calculus.md","title":"参数化有限证明演算","display":"df-proof-calculus — 参数化有限证明演算","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-proof-calculus","aliases":["28-df-proof-calculus"],"display":"df-proof-calculus — 参数化有限证明演算","depends_on":[],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-proof-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-proof-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-calculus — 参数化有限证明演算"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 为给定表达式集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\">\\(\\mathcal P=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})\\)</span> 为候选演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq E\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(E^m\\times E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(E^m\\times E)\\)</span>。一条规则是前提列与结论组成的有序对；零前提规则允许存在。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq E\">\\(T\\subseteq E\\)</span> 是额外假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\{(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)\\in E^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(e_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_m)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^m\\;((e_{j_1},\\ldots,e_{j_m}),e_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\{(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)\\in E^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(e_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_m)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^m\\;((e_{j_1},\\ldots,e_{j_m}),e_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\{e\\in E\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\cap E^n\\;d_n=e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\{e\\in E\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\cap E^n\\;d_n=e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给出参数化有限推导机制，替代对外书某个未固定矢列系统的依赖。没有指定规则时只定义“相对于所给规则集”的推导，不默认其可靠或完备。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Rules})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rules}\\subseteq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}(E^m\\times E)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\{(e_1,\\ldots,e_n)\\in E^n\\mid\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(e_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(j_1,\\ldots,j_m)\\in\\{1,\\ldots,i-1\\}^m\\;((e_{j_1},\\ldots,e_{j_m}),e_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rules})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\coloneqq\\{e\\in E\\mid\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ \\exists d\\in\\operatorname{Der}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\cap E^n\\;d_n=e\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1428,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2ad697ec40c2a04","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\times\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)$ 是有限矢列集，see [[28-df-sequent]]。$\\mathrm{SC}$ 是 $E$ 上的给定演算，see [[28-df-proof-calculus]]，$\\Gamma,\\Delta$ 有限。"},{"id":"38723883e53900a8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[28-df-sentence]] 中固定的一阶签名；$E=\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$T\\subseteq E$，$\\varphi\\in E$，see [[28-df-sentence]]。$\\mathcal P$ 是 $E$ 上的演算，see [[28-df-proof-calculus]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本地逻辑支撑：[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]、[[28-df-proof-calculus]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}